              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Baeb. 3.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ne nga aamuruma khukhwama Kadeshi-barinea namulaka muche mubukule sibala nisio aaba ne alikho amuelesia enywe mwingisie, mwamukholela sileka. Se mwamusuubila namwe mwamuria tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaba barengu khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi khukhwama nga ese ne mumanya enywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nio nakona mafumala ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi khu ndaalo kamakhumi kane echo, sikila Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aaba abisiisie khumubunia enywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali ese nasaba Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ndi, ‘Ee Omwami WELE, okhabunia babaandu bowo ne kumukabwa kwowo tawe. Ewe wamwene owabareesia khukhwama Misiri ne kamaani kowo kamakali ne bunyali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khebulila bakholi bowo Aburahamu, Isaaka ne Yakobo mala okhaloleelesia sileka sie babaandu bano namwe, bubi ne bubwoni bwabwe tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakhola orio, be mu sibala nimwo wakhurusiamo baliloma bali, “Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi se anyala khubayila mu sibala nisio aabalaka tawe sikila beele ababiila. Abarusia e Misiri nio abeerere mu sichiimi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakhaba kario babaandu bano bali babowo, nibo ewe warusia mu Misiri ne bunyali bwowo bukali ne kamaani.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
